1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Remote job scams are exploding. Here's how to spot one in ten seconds.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:09,500
The FTC says task scam reports went from about five thousand in all of 2023 to about twenty thousand in just the first half of 2024.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:13,500
Job scam losses topped two hundred twenty million dollars in those six months.

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:18,000
Red flag one: you have to pay. For training, equipment, or to unlock earnings.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,500
Red flag two: a recruiter texts you out of nowhere and moves you to WhatsApp or Telegram.

6
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:26,000
Red flag three: a chat-only interview with an instant offer.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,500
Remember: legit jobs pay you. You never pay them.

8
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:33,500
Report scams at report fraud dot f-t-c dot gov. Follow for safe, verified jobs.
